  lines:
  - WARNING AIRLOCK PISTONS FAULTY
  - User, you must locate,,, FIVE,,, pressure valves throughout the facility to equalize
    the pressure and to prevent the implosion of the facility
  - ONE is on Floor ALPHA
  - TWO are on Floor BETA
  - And TWO are on Floor CHARLIE
  - Beware of drifting naval contact IEDs
  - My facility scans show electronics rigged with plastic explosives near the lower
    levels, setting one off will likely disable your suit and cause a premature implosion
    of the facility, so tread lightly.
  - setting one off will likely disable your suit and cause a premature implosion
